/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (We are a musical band dedicated to celebrating the timeless beauty of Indian music. Our performances feature iconic regional and Hindi Bollywood songs, along with the soulful traditions of Bhajan, Thumri, Ghazal, and Sufi music. What sets us apart is our signature Indian classical touch, blending rich ragas and intricate rhythms with familiar melodies to create an immersive and unforgettable musical experience. The ensemble weaves harmonies of  Keyboard, Guitars , Harmonium, Flute, Tabla, and drums. Immerse yourself in this unique musical journey.)
